<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets 10 billion yen FRN. [CORRECTED 09:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets 10 billion yen FRN. [CORRECTED 09:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    01.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -11 BP    PAY DATE    14.JUL.97</p>
<p>(Corrects margin from +11 bp to -11 bp)</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.156   FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
